<p>Reh Gaye Dasht Main Tanha to Watan Yaad Aya<br> Pani Paya to Har Ek Tashna Dahan Yaad Aya&nbsp;<br> Leky Har Chez Madiny Se Chali The Zainab&nbsp;<br> Bhai Ke Lash Pe Pohnchi To Kafan Yaad Aya</p> 
<p>So Rahy Hain Sab Mere Waali o Dilbar Rait Par&nbsp;<br> Bano Bethi He Rahain Ge Zindage Bhar Rait Par</p> 
<p>1) Hoti Chadar Saya Karti Haye Kitne Dhoop Hai<br> Soraha Hai Aag Ke Maidan Main Akbar Rait Par&nbsp;</p> 
<p>2) Piyas Main Bachon Ke Kuch Hojati the Shiddat Siwa&nbsp;<br> Phaiktay Thy Jab Adu Pani Dekha Kar Rait Par</p> 
<p>3) Jhoola Tera Jal Gaya to Kya Howa Aye Mery Laal&nbsp;<br> Loriyan Dongi Tujhe Aja Leta Kar Rait Par</p> 
<p>4) Baap Ke Ceny Par Sir Rakh Kar Jisay Atti Ho Neend&nbsp;<br> Kesy Soye Shah Ke Wo Nanni Dukhtar Rait Par</p> 
<p>5) Shaam Ke Rastay Main Sar Shabbir Ka Us Dum Ruka&nbsp;<br> Gir Gaye Naqay Se&nbsp; Jab Bano Ke Dukhtar Rait Par</p> 
<p>6) Honge Asan Mushkilain Aur Ziyarat e Shabbir Bhe&nbsp;<br> Jab Anees Hoga Lahad Main Tera Bister Rait Par&nbsp;</p>